stanzas:
[E]Sing them o[A]ver a[E]gain to [B7]me,
Wonderful [G#m]words of [E]life;
Let me more [A]of their [E]beauty [B7]see,
Wonderful [G#m]words of [E]life.
[E]Words of life and [A]beau[E]ty
Teach me faith and [A]du[E]ty;

Christ, the blessed One, gives to all
Wonderful words of life;
Sinner, list to the loving call,
Wonderful words of life.
All so freely given,
Wooing us to heaven;

Sweetly echo the Gospel call,
Wonderful words of life;
Offer pardon and peace to all,
Wonderful words of life.
Jesus, only Savior,
Sanctify forever;
